    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "New Relic trace lookup (US / account8572010)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 48,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "[New Relic US](https://one.newrelic.com/) → Account 8572010 → Query your data. Use \n```sql\nSELECT * FROM Span WHERE trace.id = '<trace_id>' SINCE 30 minutes ago\n```\n; filter the backtick-quoted `service.version` attribute by the source SHA. Correlate the JSON log request_id/trace_id and HTTP/DB parent IDs. Never paste License Key, SQL, request body or email into a query."
      }
    }
